WEBVTT

01:18.700 --> 01:21.770
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.940 --> 01:24.860
[Episode 23]

01:24.940 --> 01:26.510
The trash can in my bathroom

01:26.530 --> 01:27.860
needs to be cleared out.

01:28.010 --> 01:30.039
You really love
playing the boss, don't you?

01:30.039 --> 01:31.560
I'll fill it up right now!

01:35.170 --> 01:37.370
Come on. Have some porridge to sober up.

01:45.440 --> 01:47.720
You two are quite close.

01:49.120 --> 01:51.039
-You are romantically involved.
-Huh?

01:51.039 --> 01:53.350
Can't all this food shut you up?

01:56.450 --> 01:58.740
By the way,
I wanted to say this last night that

01:58.740 --> 02:00.990
I hadn't interacted much
with Li Yifei before.

02:00.990 --> 02:02.920
But when we had dinner
with him yesterday,

02:02.920 --> 02:05.400
he looked really familiar.

02:06.440 --> 02:07.360
He has an average face.

02:07.360 --> 02:08.560
No, no, that's not it.

02:08.639 --> 02:10.740
I was looking for investments everywhere.

02:10.740 --> 02:12.060
And I went to

02:12.080 --> 02:13.880
the chairman of Qiansheng Group.

02:13.880 --> 02:14.630
Then...

02:14.660 --> 02:16.950
When I saw
the chairman of Qiansheng Group,

02:16.950 --> 02:19.160
I just felt that

02:19.760 --> 02:20.200
he and Li Yifei,

02:20.200 --> 02:22.520
I can't say for sure, look alike.

02:23.110 --> 02:23.760
And,

02:24.140 --> 02:24.900
Li...

02:25.280 --> 02:26.670
The chairman of Qiansheng Group

02:26.670 --> 02:28.800
also has the surname Li, Li Qiansheng.

02:30.610 --> 02:32.490
Qiansheng, I remember.

02:32.510 --> 02:34.480
Wang Ruohai wanted to
join Qiansheng when he graduated.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.860
He submitted his resume three times
but got rejected by Qiansheng,

02:35.860 --> 02:36.420
right?

02:37.450 --> 02:39.200
This is getting more and more ridiculous.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.260
Just drink some porridge to sober up.

02:42.740 --> 02:44.329
I'm not quite sure.
Don't take it seriously.

02:44.329 --> 02:45.490
It suddenly came to my mind.

02:45.490 --> 02:46.210
But I

02:46.280 --> 02:47.480
really feel they

02:48.020 --> 02:49.460
look a bit alike.

02:55.100 --> 02:56.860
Stretch the left side.

02:59.780 --> 03:00.390
Come up.

03:00.390 --> 03:02.950
Stretch your arms and waist.

03:06.440 --> 03:07.420
Switch sides.

03:10.710 --> 03:13.110
All right. That's it for today's class.

03:13.140 --> 03:14.210
See you next week.

03:14.390 --> 03:16.710
Goodbye, Ms. Yu.

03:16.710 --> 03:17.740
Bye.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.079
Your class is over?

03:36.230 --> 03:37.090
Your class ended, too?

03:37.090 --> 03:37.680
Yes.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.230
Yesterday,

03:39.460 --> 03:41.490
you spent New Year's Eve with Jun?

03:41.990 --> 03:42.550
Yes.

03:42.870 --> 03:44.180
He said he told you.

03:44.340 --> 03:44.990
Yes.

03:45.020 --> 03:47.010
He told me.

03:47.579 --> 03:49.270
Come on in and have a seat.

03:54.230 --> 03:55.230
Come on, sit down.

03:56.060 --> 03:56.829
You must be tired.

03:56.829 --> 03:57.710
I'm fine.

03:59.990 --> 04:01.180
I was thinking.

04:01.180 --> 04:03.500
From now on,

04:03.530 --> 04:05.960
I don't want to interfere with
young people's lives anymore.

04:05.960 --> 04:09.800
I just hope we can understand each other.

04:11.690 --> 04:13.840
I only have one son.

04:13.940 --> 04:15.090
Sometimes,

04:15.110 --> 04:17.430
if I did something out of line,

04:18.380 --> 04:19.510
please bear with me.

04:20.430 --> 04:21.870
Please don't say that.

04:23.820 --> 04:24.800
From now on,

04:24.820 --> 04:26.500
I won't stop you two anymore.

04:26.990 --> 04:29.380
To be honest, I can't stop you anyway.

04:31.260 --> 04:34.470
Parents always compromise
with their children.

04:35.110 --> 04:36.350
Actually,

04:36.430 --> 04:38.500
what is the purpose of dating?

04:39.110 --> 04:41.909
The purpose of dating is marriage.

04:41.909 --> 04:43.820
Right? Get married and have kids.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.740
As for me now,

04:46.670 --> 04:49.230
the only thing
I'm not satisfied with about you

04:49.230 --> 04:51.430
is that I feel you're not stable enough.

04:52.430 --> 04:54.430
You're always running around, right?

04:54.430 --> 04:55.350
It's better for a girl

04:55.350 --> 04:58.210
to have stable life

04:58.300 --> 04:59.670
and a stable job,

04:59.740 --> 05:01.380
and settle down.

05:01.380 --> 05:01.990
Auntie,

05:04.230 --> 05:06.820
well, you've come to me so many times.

05:07.590 --> 05:10.060
So, today, I'll make it clear to you.

05:12.230 --> 05:13.060
First of all,

05:13.090 --> 05:14.840
I understand your love for Jun.

05:15.990 --> 05:17.190
But I can't accept it.

05:17.790 --> 05:19.210
What can't you accept?

05:19.280 --> 05:20.110
I can't accept that

05:20.110 --> 05:22.300
you always want me to change myself.

05:23.050 --> 05:24.620
Even if I listen to you now

05:24.620 --> 05:26.140
to get a stable job,

05:26.170 --> 05:27.140
what if

05:27.180 --> 05:29.230
you ask me to change

05:29.300 --> 05:30.740
my personality and lifestyle

05:30.740 --> 05:33.030
when Jun and I get married?

05:33.680 --> 05:35.040
Taking a step back,

05:35.070 --> 05:36.260
if I make changes

05:36.260 --> 05:37.500
according to your ideas,

05:37.500 --> 05:40.159
you'll be fully satisfied,
but I won't be happy.

05:40.470 --> 05:42.800
Then, what's the point of
my marrying Jun?

05:43.620 --> 05:44.380
I admit that

05:44.380 --> 05:46.110
I do have feelings for Jun now.

05:47.460 --> 05:49.260
But these feelings

05:49.260 --> 05:51.620
can't withstand all your rules.

05:52.950 --> 05:54.480
So, rather than this,

05:54.550 --> 05:56.790
I'd prefer to just be friends with him.

05:57.740 --> 05:59.030
Just friends?

05:59.700 --> 06:00.230
Yes.

06:01.870 --> 06:03.560
Please go back and tell him

06:03.620 --> 06:05.020
not to come to me anymore.

06:05.620 --> 06:06.820
The same goes for you.

06:15.230 --> 06:18.760
With her bad temper, being just friends
with her is good for Jun.

06:35.670 --> 06:37.820
Landlady, what's for lunch?

06:38.300 --> 06:39.900
I'm not eating. I'm on a diet.

06:46.110 --> 06:47.310
But

06:47.620 --> 06:50.500
I just saw the eggs you bought.

06:48.450 --> 06:50.170
[Da Hong Pao]

06:51.230 --> 06:53.540
That kind of super expensive tea again.

06:54.590 --> 06:56.470
Why do you talk so much nonsense?

06:57.180 --> 07:00.730
For the sponsor representative exam,
you have to make a systematic plan.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.470
[Da Hong Pao]

07:00.790 --> 07:03.120
There are six months left until your exam.

07:03.300 --> 07:05.740
I've already made a customized study plan
for you

07:05.740 --> 07:08.070
based on your current level and progress.

07:09.080 --> 07:11.260
You've gotten everything ready for me?

07:11.260 --> 07:12.390
So,

07:12.430 --> 07:14.090
hurry up and boil the tea eggs.

07:14.740 --> 07:16.820
Then, come listen to my lecture.

07:17.470 --> 07:18.500
Yes, sir!

07:21.910 --> 07:24.250
[Da Hong Pao]

07:32.300 --> 07:35.280
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

07:36.230 --> 07:40.010
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

07:40.650 --> 07:42.340
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

07:42.810 --> 07:44.450
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

07:44.820 --> 07:47.010
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

07:47.580 --> 07:49.180
♪ Or the kitten in the afternoon ♪

07:49.830 --> 07:53.620
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

07:54.170 --> 07:57.790
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

07:58.510 --> 07:59.940
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

08:00.400 --> 08:02.220
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

08:02.690 --> 08:04.800
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

08:05.540 --> 08:06.590
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

08:16.210 --> 08:19.180
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

08:20.140 --> 08:23.540
♪ You always bump into my little secrets ♪

08:24.390 --> 08:26.150
♪ In my eyebrows and eyelashes ♪

08:26.580 --> 08:28.080
♪ In the curve of my lips, in my hair ♪

08:28.570 --> 08:30.740
♪ Like the raindrops in spring I like ♪

08:33.580 --> 08:37.230
♪ Hey, you, why is it you again? ♪

08:37.890 --> 08:41.309
♪ You always easily arouse my desire
to protect you ♪

08:42.020 --> 08:43.460
♪ Seeing through my secret thoughts ♪

08:44.120 --> 08:45.610
♪ My hesitation, and my moody side ♪

08:46.130 --> 08:48.440
♪ Like the beer and fried chicken
in autumn I like ♪

08:48.960 --> 08:50.560
♪ And the spicy fish in winter ♪

08:50.870 --> 08:54.610
♪ Why is it you again?
In such a sweet tone ♪

08:55.060 --> 08:59.040
♪ It's like the whole world knows
I miss you ♪

08:59.740 --> 09:03.420
♪ Why is it always you?
With a cool chuckle ♪

09:03.880 --> 09:07.690
♪ Let me play along and protect you ♪

09:12.030 --> 09:15.650
[Inpatient Department]

09:46.990 --> 09:48.050
Come on, slow down.

09:48.250 --> 09:48.930
Be careful.

09:55.660 --> 09:56.140
Dad.

09:56.470 --> 09:57.710
Everything is arranged inside.

09:57.710 --> 09:58.520
You can go in.

09:58.670 --> 10:01.430
[Inpatient Building No.1]

09:59.380 --> 10:01.590
Your mom's surgery was successful.

10:01.620 --> 10:02.830
She is recovering well.

10:02.830 --> 10:04.170
She could stay anywhere to recover.

10:04.170 --> 10:05.350
Transferring her to Shanghai

10:05.350 --> 10:06.620
has caused you so much trouble.

10:06.620 --> 10:07.900
It's okay.

10:07.930 --> 10:09.660
My friend arranged all of this.

10:09.940 --> 10:11.270
[Inpatient Building No.1]

10:10.250 --> 10:11.510
Go and take care of her.

10:11.510 --> 10:14.070
[Shanghai Kangde Hospital]

10:28.020 --> 10:33.200
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

10:28.360 --> 10:28.890
Hello.

10:29.350 --> 10:30.790
Hello, Shiyu.

10:31.140 --> 10:31.940
Ruohai.

10:32.090 --> 10:33.620
Did you bring your mom here?

10:33.740 --> 10:35.630
Yes, everything went smoothly.

10:36.050 --> 10:37.550
Your arrangements were perfect.

10:37.550 --> 10:38.380
Thank you.

10:38.620 --> 10:40.680
You don't need to be so polite with me.

10:40.790 --> 10:41.390
By the way,

10:42.270 --> 10:43.060
are you busy now?

10:43.060 --> 10:43.830
If you're not busy,

10:43.830 --> 10:46.360
is it convenient for you
to come and visit her?

10:47.870 --> 10:48.420
Ruohai,

10:48.590 --> 10:51.140
I understand you taking time off
to take care of your mom,

10:51.140 --> 10:52.850
but the company is quite busy right now.

10:52.850 --> 10:54.900
It's a holiday. We're short-staffed.

10:54.900 --> 10:55.830
I can't get away.

10:55.950 --> 10:57.810
Actually, letting your mom
come to Shanghai to recuperate

10:57.810 --> 11:00.190
is because
we have the best caregivers here.

11:00.190 --> 11:02.660
They know how to care for
patients better than you do.

11:02.660 --> 11:04.260
This is also to put your mind at ease.

11:04.260 --> 11:05.540
A person's energy

11:05.660 --> 11:07.190
should be placed where it best reflects

11:07.190 --> 11:08.480
their value.

11:08.780 --> 11:10.240
Superficial filial piety

11:10.260 --> 11:13.190
actually drains the efficiency of
the whole family.

11:13.380 --> 11:14.180
I understand.

11:14.740 --> 11:15.870
I mean,

11:15.900 --> 11:17.740
she's just recovering
from a serious illness

11:17.740 --> 11:19.020
and just arrived in Shanghai.

11:19.020 --> 11:20.270
My parents are unfamiliar with this place.

11:20.270 --> 11:21.020
I'm thinking that

11:21.020 --> 11:21.990
if you can come

11:21.990 --> 11:22.990
and visit her now,

11:23.190 --> 11:24.450
she will be very happy.

11:24.830 --> 11:25.540
Or...

11:25.540 --> 11:27.420
Ms. Liao,
the meeting will start in 5 minutes.

11:27.420 --> 11:29.020
Please keep an eye on the time.

11:29.020 --> 11:29.420
Okay.

11:29.540 --> 11:30.870
Come in and tell me in 4 minutes.

11:30.870 --> 11:31.420
Okay.

11:32.900 --> 11:35.160
Ruohai, I'm really too busy here.

11:35.350 --> 11:36.620
I will have a meeting with

11:36.620 --> 11:38.310
several managers of other hotels later.

11:38.310 --> 11:40.900
The breaking news of our hotel
hasn't been solved yet.

11:40.900 --> 11:42.380
I really can't get away right now.

11:42.380 --> 11:44.180
I'll visit Auntie
when I get the chance, okay?

11:44.180 --> 11:44.940
Okay.

11:45.740 --> 11:47.070
Go ahead with your work.

11:58.610 --> 12:01.150
[Shanghai Kangde Hospital]

12:23.660 --> 12:24.660
Hello, Dad.

12:25.350 --> 12:26.830
Hello, Fei.

12:27.540 --> 12:29.140
I have something to tell you.

12:29.380 --> 12:30.020
What's up?

12:31.070 --> 12:32.200
I just found out that

12:32.500 --> 12:34.900
the son of my old leader,

12:34.990 --> 12:36.260
who once arranged a job for me,

12:36.260 --> 12:37.620
is also in Shanghai.

12:38.420 --> 12:39.230
This week,

12:39.420 --> 12:41.420
take your spare time to buy some gifts

12:41.420 --> 12:42.620
and go visit his son.

12:43.530 --> 12:45.720
Your old leader? Which one?

12:45.740 --> 12:47.670
Why didn't you mention him before?

12:48.650 --> 12:50.400
That was a long time ago.

12:50.660 --> 12:52.320
You were too young to know him.

12:52.540 --> 12:54.380
He showed me great kindness.

12:55.500 --> 12:57.620
The young man will add you
on WeChat later.

12:57.620 --> 12:58.870
Accept his request.

13:06.690 --> 13:06.930
[WeChat]

13:06.950 --> 13:07.990
[Yuan Feng, request to
add you as a friend]

13:10.790 --> 13:11.270
[Loading]

13:11.290 --> 13:12.510
[Yuan Feng] [Send Message]

13:12.560 --> 13:13.190
[I'm Yuan Feng. My personal information]

13:13.210 --> 13:14.150
[is in my Moments.]

13:14.950 --> 13:16.110
The Moments?

13:21.710 --> 13:24.190
I am 1.75 meters tall.

13:24.220 --> 13:25.430
I have a stable job.

13:26.030 --> 13:29.570
I'm not a local, but I've settled
in Shanghai.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.320
I plan to buy a car this year.

13:31.340 --> 13:33.870
I like sports and have no bad habits.

13:35.530 --> 13:38.220
So, this is a blind date setup after all.

13:42.050 --> 13:43.580
[Friend Settings] [Delete]

13:54.900 --> 13:56.620
It's so comfortable at home.

13:56.780 --> 13:57.850
There's good food.

13:57.870 --> 14:00.130
And after eating, I can play video games.

14:01.030 --> 14:02.940
Dad, Mom, come out and eat.

14:03.470 --> 14:04.500
Okay, coming.

14:06.930 --> 14:09.230
It doesn't seem like Jun got dumped.

14:09.620 --> 14:10.190
Shut up.

14:10.900 --> 14:12.300
Let's observe a bit more.

14:44.260 --> 14:46.420
The atmosphere is a little strange today.

14:46.420 --> 14:48.710
Dad, why aren't you getting food for Mom?

14:50.260 --> 14:52.350
Mom, why aren't you nagging me?

15:06.380 --> 15:09.240
Is there really something
going on between you two?

15:13.140 --> 15:15.220
Mom, could it be that

15:15.490 --> 15:16.950
Dad is having an affair?

15:17.950 --> 15:19.070
Show some respect.

15:21.390 --> 15:23.250
As long as you're fine. Let's eat.

15:28.900 --> 15:30.790
Are things going well
between you and Dang?

15:30.790 --> 15:32.260
Very well.

15:33.380 --> 15:35.420
Mom, thanks to your support.

15:37.540 --> 15:39.140
It's so good to have you here.

15:42.590 --> 15:44.740
Eat the chicken your son gave you.

16:08.230 --> 16:10.110
Why didn't you go online today?

16:10.590 --> 16:11.830
Are you at the bar?

16:11.950 --> 16:13.240
I'll pick you up later.

16:16.190 --> 16:17.920
Do you want a late-night snack?

16:17.990 --> 16:19.450
How about pan-fried buns?

16:48.500 --> 16:49.830
Why are you ignoring me?

17:02.380 --> 17:03.440
What are you doing?

17:08.829 --> 17:09.869
Jun.

17:11.950 --> 17:14.560
You'd better go back to
the dorm.

17:16.250 --> 17:18.619
I just got back. Why are you
driving me away again?

17:18.619 --> 17:19.180
You...

17:19.420 --> 17:21.369
You've been so busy these days,

17:21.550 --> 17:23.810
going back and forth for work.

17:23.849 --> 17:24.849
Aren't you tired?

17:28.109 --> 17:29.290
Got it.

17:29.350 --> 17:31.300
You two find me annoying, right?

17:31.460 --> 17:32.620
Okay.

17:35.220 --> 17:36.680
I'm coming over right now.

17:47.700 --> 17:48.110
Dad.

17:48.660 --> 17:50.390
I got it.

17:59.940 --> 18:00.720
I'm leaving.

18:06.070 --> 18:06.700
Honey.

18:07.380 --> 18:09.900
Are you afraid that if our son
breaks up with his girlfriend,

18:09.900 --> 18:11.220
he will make a scene with you?

18:11.220 --> 18:11.980
He dares not.

18:13.940 --> 18:16.660
But seriously, if I quarrel with him,

18:16.690 --> 18:18.350
who do you think will suffer the most?

18:18.350 --> 18:18.830
Me.

18:19.460 --> 18:20.700
Glad you know it.

18:20.940 --> 18:21.550
Right?

18:25.550 --> 18:27.130
Anyway, that's how it is.

18:27.310 --> 18:28.750
Since your mom didn't tell you,

18:28.750 --> 18:29.880
I'm telling you now.

18:29.940 --> 18:32.070
We're just common friends from now on.

18:33.380 --> 18:33.980
Yu.

18:34.350 --> 18:36.380
Don't take what my mom said to heart.

18:36.870 --> 18:39.110
I like you, and I want to be with you.

18:39.270 --> 18:39.980
Besides,

18:40.220 --> 18:42.350
I don't care about what she said at all.

18:44.420 --> 18:46.900
I'm really happy to be with you.

18:47.420 --> 18:49.200
But I can't accept a marriage

18:49.270 --> 18:50.420
with shackles.

18:51.180 --> 18:52.180
And you have no way to

18:52.180 --> 18:53.710
change your mother's mind.

18:53.940 --> 18:55.670
So, let's just leave it at that.

18:55.750 --> 18:58.680
From now on, I'm Bad Name,
and you are Prime Minister.

18:58.790 --> 19:01.850
We can play games together again
when we get the chance.

19:06.510 --> 19:08.220
My taxi is here. I'm leaving.

20:01.680 --> 20:04.610
Dad, Mom, I know you are at home.

20:04.630 --> 20:05.830
Open the door for me.

20:06.270 --> 20:08.870
You even disabled my key.
Isn't that childish?

20:09.900 --> 20:10.790
Honey.

20:11.550 --> 20:12.870
Judging by his tone,

20:13.140 --> 20:14.940
Dang must have made

20:14.980 --> 20:16.380
this matter clear to him.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.980
Can you stop talking?

20:17.980 --> 20:18.350
Yes.

20:26.900 --> 20:27.620
Mom.

20:28.230 --> 20:30.120
I know why you kicked me out.

20:30.270 --> 20:31.470
We need to have a talk.

20:33.790 --> 20:34.380
Mom.

20:38.070 --> 20:38.750
Honey.

20:38.830 --> 20:40.700
You mean well.

20:40.940 --> 20:42.620
Just let him in and explain it clearly.

20:42.620 --> 20:43.700
Wouldn't that be better?

20:43.700 --> 20:44.900
I'll go open the door.

20:47.460 --> 20:49.030
What are you doing?

20:49.050 --> 20:50.720
Can I even explain myself now?

20:50.870 --> 20:52.800
Whatever I say, I'll be the bad guy.

20:58.140 --> 20:59.590
From today,

20:59.660 --> 21:00.980
I'm washing my hands of everything.

21:00.980 --> 21:03.790
Let him figure it out
and deal with it himself.

21:05.140 --> 21:06.620
Okay, honey. Don't be mad.

21:07.050 --> 21:09.250
[Dear son]

21:10.960 --> 21:12.560
I knew he would call us.

21:15.460 --> 21:16.990
You have to answer his call.

21:22.380 --> 21:25.250
Mom, I can hear your phone ringing.

21:29.510 --> 21:32.250
Sorry, the number you dialed is busy.

21:45.940 --> 21:46.590
Look.

21:47.420 --> 21:48.950
Read the message our son sent you.

21:48.950 --> 21:50.000
[Mom, is your pride as a local
more important]

21:50.020 --> 21:51.250
[or your son's happiness?]

21:51.270 --> 21:52.830
[If it's the former, then
please don't impose that on me.]

21:52.390 --> 21:54.030
What an awful attitude he has!

21:52.860 --> 21:54.390
[If it's the latter,
let me pursue my happiness on my own.]

21:54.030 --> 21:55.750
How could he say so?

21:56.380 --> 21:58.160
He's being so aggressive.

22:00.510 --> 22:02.370
How could you say that to your mom?

22:02.460 --> 22:03.790
You are too aggressive.

22:03.900 --> 22:05.830
Wait and see how I'll deal with you.

22:05.900 --> 22:07.100
I taught him a lesson.

22:27.930 --> 22:29.060
He went downstairs.

22:58.700 --> 23:00.980
One must taste the bitterness of love.

23:01.340 --> 23:02.480
Don't worry, honey.

23:03.220 --> 23:04.620
He will get over it.

23:06.700 --> 23:08.350
That little brat

23:09.180 --> 23:10.140
really left.

23:17.310 --> 23:20.310
It's the first day of work
in the new year. Ride with me.

23:21.310 --> 23:22.570
Do I need to pay for oil?

23:23.380 --> 23:26.310
That depends on what we will have
for dinner tonight.

23:26.700 --> 23:28.460
I might not be back for dinner tonight.

23:28.460 --> 23:29.510
I can tell.

23:31.220 --> 23:32.990
You dressed up so nicely.

23:33.070 --> 23:35.870
Where will you go tonight?
Who are you eating with?

23:39.980 --> 23:40.830
What is this?

23:43.920 --> 23:46.320
You actually bring a makeup bag
to work now?

23:48.460 --> 23:49.510
What's going on?

23:50.660 --> 23:51.830
What do you mean?

23:51.830 --> 23:52.620
I'm a woman.

23:52.650 --> 23:54.550
It's normal for me
to bring a makeup bag to work.

23:54.550 --> 23:55.310
It's abnormal.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.110
When did you ever bring a makeup bag

23:56.110 --> 23:57.180
or touch up your makeup

23:57.180 --> 23:58.780
when you went to work before?

24:02.590 --> 24:03.620
Come on, don't bring it.

24:03.620 --> 24:04.360
You're...

24:04.380 --> 24:06.830
Look at you,
you're dressed like a bear now.

24:06.830 --> 24:08.380
There's no point in
bringing a makeup bag with you.

24:08.380 --> 24:09.180
Put it away.

24:09.270 --> 24:12.110
I call this a hidden gem, okay?

24:22.750 --> 24:25.750
What are you looking at?
What's with that expression?

24:25.790 --> 24:28.030
I'm just shocked by your flashy outfit.

24:29.520 --> 24:32.080
What does this mean?
It's winter.

24:32.180 --> 24:34.820
You showed your bare legs with no pants.

24:36.510 --> 24:37.710
What do you want to do?

24:38.350 --> 24:40.900
No wonder you're wrapped in a down jacket,

24:41.030 --> 24:43.090
are you afraid of freezing your legs?

24:44.790 --> 24:46.090
In just a few seconds,

24:46.110 --> 24:48.120
you observed quite carefully.

24:48.790 --> 24:50.930
That's unnecessary.
You're just going to work.

24:50.930 --> 24:52.620
Come on, go change.

24:52.650 --> 24:53.330
No.

24:55.940 --> 24:57.030
I just want to dress up nicely

24:57.030 --> 24:58.510
for work

24:58.620 --> 25:00.550
to please myself and respect my job.

25:00.550 --> 25:01.280
Is that okay?

25:03.180 --> 25:04.590
I learned this from a magazine,

25:04.590 --> 25:06.270
which was given by you.

25:06.420 --> 25:07.700
Why does it look good on models

25:07.700 --> 25:08.900
but not on me?

25:09.900 --> 25:12.140
Yes, you dressed up nicely.

25:12.420 --> 25:13.830
But you're usually so tomboyish

25:13.830 --> 25:14.630
and careless.

25:14.660 --> 25:15.750
Everyone is used to that.

25:15.750 --> 25:16.700
You suddenly changed your style today.

25:16.700 --> 25:19.550
I'm afraid it will lower
your colleagues' work efficiency.

25:19.550 --> 25:20.300
Change it.

25:20.420 --> 25:21.310
Bah, no.

25:21.390 --> 25:23.160
Then you can't take off this jacket
when you are in the office.

25:23.160 --> 25:24.880
No, I'll die of heat.

25:25.420 --> 25:26.350
I told you not to take it off.

25:26.350 --> 25:27.270
You'll affect the company's efficiency.

25:27.270 --> 25:29.120
How can everyone work

25:29.140 --> 25:30.510
and meet their targets today?

25:30.510 --> 25:32.550
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

25:39.590 --> 25:40.450
We're the first ones here.

25:40.450 --> 25:41.450
Don't take it off.

25:43.460 --> 25:44.340
Are you trying to roast me?

25:44.340 --> 25:45.620
You won't. The AC is broken.

25:45.620 --> 25:46.380
How do you know it's broken?

25:46.380 --> 25:47.980
Yeah, what I said is the fact.

25:50.620 --> 25:52.190
I told you not to take it off.

26:05.380 --> 26:06.620
Or you'll freeze to death later.

26:06.620 --> 26:08.480
I said don't take it off. Put it on.

26:08.510 --> 26:09.380
Is that okay?

26:16.900 --> 26:17.900
Don't take it off.

26:25.030 --> 26:26.430
Can't I take off my scarf?

26:56.920 --> 26:58.260
[Hello, Qian Fei.] I know your situation.

26:58.290 --> 27:00.080
[Can we meet after work today?]

27:12.180 --> 27:13.580
[I'm sorry. The project is tight.]

27:13.600 --> 27:15.490
[I'll ask you out when I'm done.]

27:24.720 --> 27:26.670
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

27:47.880 --> 27:48.480
Qian Fei.

27:51.110 --> 27:52.040
Why is it so cold?

27:52.270 --> 27:53.370
The AC is broken.

27:55.010 --> 27:56.070
I'll ask the property management
to fix it.

27:56.070 --> 27:57.510
No need. It's written on it.

27:57.510 --> 27:59.070
Property management department will
come fix it tomorrow.

27:57.690 --> 27:58.170
[The air conditioner is broken.
Will fix it tomorrow.]

27:58.190 --> 27:59.320
[Please put on your coats
to prevent a cold.]

28:01.980 --> 28:03.180
Then, stay warm.

28:03.210 --> 28:05.070
It's fine. We're wearing layers.

28:09.690 --> 28:12.380
Don't catch a cold, you two.

28:12.790 --> 28:14.870
You're not wearing enough clothes.
Don't catch a cold.

28:14.870 --> 28:16.380
Look at the bruise on his face.

28:16.380 --> 28:17.180
You hit him...

28:17.270 --> 28:19.400
I almost forgot the serious business.

28:19.460 --> 28:21.180
Pass this to Director Fang.

28:22.180 --> 28:22.660
Okay.

28:27.510 --> 28:28.220
Wear more.

28:31.380 --> 28:32.690
You hit him pretty hard.

28:32.690 --> 28:34.590
The bruise on his face
hasn't faded for days.

28:34.590 --> 28:36.250
He didn't hit lightly either.

28:36.580 --> 28:38.570
Then why is your face so clean?

28:39.260 --> 28:41.020
Look who put the medicine on me.

28:41.040 --> 28:41.520
Right?

28:44.070 --> 28:44.720
You.

28:53.270 --> 28:55.060
[A shining gold]

28:59.700 --> 29:01.900
This girl looks so familiar.

29:04.660 --> 29:07.240
[A shining gold]

29:11.270 --> 29:12.730
It's her.

29:13.140 --> 29:14.270
I can't believe Li Yifei

29:14.270 --> 29:16.350
knows a famous internet celebrity.

29:22.120 --> 29:25.650
Turns out they don't just know each other.
They're quite close.

29:40.240 --> 29:42.670
[Yuan Feng]

30:08.940 --> 30:09.620
Qian Fei,

30:10.350 --> 30:12.100
why do you look so good
these past two days?

30:12.100 --> 30:13.760
You look different every day.

30:14.140 --> 30:16.700
Today's outfit is both pure and charming.

30:17.310 --> 30:19.070
I don't think you should work
in investment banking.

30:19.070 --> 30:20.010
You should be an internet celebrity.

30:20.010 --> 30:21.670
You'd definitely be popular.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.880
Me, an internet celebrity?

30:23.900 --> 30:25.170
I'd scare people away.

30:25.190 --> 30:26.120
Nonsense.

30:29.110 --> 30:29.840
I'm leaving.

30:30.030 --> 30:30.550
Bye.

30:30.580 --> 30:31.140
Bye.

30:40.380 --> 30:41.070
Qian Fei.

30:41.220 --> 30:42.180
You're dressed so nicely.

30:42.180 --> 30:43.540
Are you going to see your boyfriend?

30:43.540 --> 30:45.400
I'm going to see an old classmate.

31:09.550 --> 31:10.280
How old is he?

31:11.660 --> 31:12.790
What are you saying?

31:13.180 --> 31:14.980
The old classmate. How old is he?

31:16.030 --> 31:17.430
I'm going on a blind date.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.540
I guessed so.

31:23.630 --> 31:24.900
You dress up so extravagantly.

31:24.900 --> 31:26.700
It's obviously for a blind date.

31:26.980 --> 31:28.720
Do you want that guy to

31:28.750 --> 31:30.480
think you're dying to meet him?

31:31.900 --> 31:34.390
I'm just showing respect, okay?

31:34.410 --> 31:36.070
Can you stop meddling in my business?

31:36.070 --> 31:37.420
Go find your girlfriend.

31:37.420 --> 31:38.110
Who?

31:38.140 --> 31:39.610
What girlfriend?

31:39.900 --> 31:41.560
I'm talking about your blind…

31:45.980 --> 31:47.380
Excuse me. Thank you.

31:47.540 --> 31:49.080
Go inside.

32:07.090 --> 32:08.470
I'll go with you.

32:10.310 --> 32:11.770
I'll check him out for you.

32:13.660 --> 32:15.020
You have too much time on your hands.

32:15.020 --> 32:16.180
What do you mean?

32:16.440 --> 32:18.760
Is this a joke? Is it a game to you?

32:24.140 --> 32:25.200
I'm going with you.

32:26.030 --> 32:27.760
I think you just want to gossip.

32:29.000 --> 32:31.040
Am I a gossiper?

32:31.850 --> 32:33.560
Once a teacher, always a teacher.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.830
Haven't you heard of this saying?

32:34.830 --> 32:36.210
My beloved apprentice
is going on a blind date.

32:36.210 --> 32:38.000
Shouldn't I be concerned?

32:38.470 --> 32:39.870
Li Yifei, is something wrong with you?

32:39.870 --> 32:41.930
Why are you meddling in my blind date?

32:41.940 --> 32:43.500
Me? I...

32:43.590 --> 32:44.420
You what?

32:45.110 --> 32:46.510
You have so many beauties around you.

32:46.510 --> 32:47.770
Why are you teasing me?

32:51.020 --> 32:53.260
Fine, I won't go. What's the big deal?

32:53.290 --> 32:54.820
What are you so cocky about?

32:55.130 --> 32:57.110
I didn't expect you
to be so beautiful in person.

32:57.110 --> 32:58.420
You are many times prettier

32:58.420 --> 33:00.250
than the photo your dad showed me.

33:00.250 --> 33:02.300
No, Mr. Yuan. You flatter me.

33:02.600 --> 33:03.860
Just call me Yuan Feng.

33:04.310 --> 33:05.460
As for my situation,

33:05.490 --> 33:06.900
you've checked my WeChat Moments,

33:06.900 --> 33:08.250
so you basically know.

33:08.780 --> 33:10.780
Like you, I'm not a local.

33:11.140 --> 33:12.540
But I have a local household registration

33:12.540 --> 33:14.080
in Pudong New Area.

33:14.380 --> 33:15.750
I work in a public institution,

33:15.750 --> 33:16.750
and I'm on the permanent staff.

33:16.750 --> 33:18.980
It's just that I haven't bought
an apartment in Shanghai.

33:18.980 --> 33:20.500
But I heard you have one.

33:21.140 --> 33:22.070
I think in this regard,

33:22.070 --> 33:23.350
we are a great match.

33:23.350 --> 33:24.040
Look.

33:24.400 --> 33:26.620
I have a local household registration,
while you have an apartment.

33:26.620 --> 33:28.140
Then, our kid can

33:28.140 --> 33:29.340
attend a good school.

33:30.210 --> 33:31.700
What happened? Are you okay?

33:31.700 --> 33:32.570
I'm fine.

33:34.110 --> 33:36.350
It's our first time meeting,

33:36.350 --> 33:38.080
so we don't need to be so formal.

33:38.230 --> 33:39.650
Let's start as friends.

33:40.220 --> 33:41.070
Yes.

33:41.510 --> 33:43.420
I am a bit practical.

33:43.550 --> 33:44.590
But to be honest,

33:45.510 --> 33:47.040
I'm looking to get married.

33:47.090 --> 33:48.110
It's a blind date,

33:48.130 --> 33:50.010
so we should figure out the basics.

33:50.010 --> 33:52.270
Otherwise, we can't keep in touch later.

33:52.460 --> 33:54.140
It's a way to show respect
to the matchmaker

33:54.140 --> 33:56.470
and especially to give your dad some hope.

33:57.270 --> 33:57.710
Yes.

33:58.010 --> 34:00.920
So, do you have any requirements for me?

34:01.080 --> 34:02.470
You can tell me.

34:03.380 --> 34:04.240
Requirements?

34:06.980 --> 34:08.310
Not really.

34:08.790 --> 34:10.980
If I have to say it,

34:11.190 --> 34:13.270
first of all, I want someone
with a good character.

34:13.270 --> 34:14.870
And the one must be ambitious

34:14.900 --> 34:16.360
and filial to his parents.

34:26.150 --> 34:26.679
Qian Fei.

34:26.790 --> 34:28.590
I don't know what you think of me,

34:28.900 --> 34:30.500
but I have a very good impression of you.

34:29.710 --> 34:29.889
[Start ordering]

34:31.750 --> 34:32.560
The thing is,

34:32.580 --> 34:34.460
I had a girlfriend before.

34:34.690 --> 34:36.340
We dated for a long time

34:36.360 --> 34:38.739
and were even talking about marriage.

34:39.590 --> 34:42.190
But she cheated on me
and was with someone else.

34:52.380 --> 34:53.469
Excuse me.

34:53.600 --> 34:54.770
Where were we?

34:55.790 --> 34:56.980
The psychological shadow, right?

34:56.980 --> 34:57.890
Yes.

35:05.500 --> 35:07.190
Don't be shy.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.280
What do you want to say?

35:10.530 --> 35:11.570
Just say it.

35:14.670 --> 35:16.830
Since you came in, you said
you'd treat me to food.

35:16.830 --> 35:18.420
I've eaten five plates of cake

35:18.420 --> 35:19.940
and drank three glasses of drinks.

35:19.940 --> 35:20.770
Tell me,

35:20.790 --> 35:23.990
what's the biggest insurance project
you're working on?

35:25.010 --> 35:27.070
Do I look like an insurance salesman?

35:28.020 --> 35:29.460
Otherwise, what do you want?

35:29.460 --> 35:30.900
You did so for my beauty?

35:33.870 --> 35:36.060
It's not impossible.

35:38.100 --> 35:38.540
Yes.

35:39.150 --> 35:39.980
Well,

35:41.420 --> 35:43.500
I sell gym memberships.

35:43.900 --> 35:44.980
We're having a promotion.

35:44.980 --> 35:45.750
Take a look.

35:46.760 --> 35:48.220
So, you sell memberships.

35:48.540 --> 35:49.310
Yes.

35:49.340 --> 35:49.920
Take a look.

35:49.920 --> 35:51.410
See if you're interested.

35:53.770 --> 35:56.380
Actually, we are both in the same boat.

35:56.580 --> 35:58.380
I've been through what you experienced.

35:58.380 --> 35:59.230
Really?

36:00.270 --> 36:03.100
Then we are both in the same boat.

36:03.130 --> 36:05.060
I think we're destined
to know each other.

36:05.060 --> 36:06.060
What the hell?

36:06.580 --> 36:07.780
Are you talking to me?

36:08.460 --> 36:09.190
No, no.

36:10.540 --> 36:11.740
Keep watching.

36:14.380 --> 36:16.840
Then, you should be able
to understand this.

36:16.870 --> 36:19.070
Love without the guarantee of marriage

36:19.230 --> 36:20.710
is simply too terrifying.

36:21.200 --> 36:23.680
Then, what exactly do you
mean by guarantee?

36:26.170 --> 36:27.970
If we establish a relationship,

36:28.670 --> 36:31.130
I think we should try
a trial marriage first.

36:31.450 --> 36:32.540
Trial marriage?

36:34.830 --> 36:36.940
But what does a trial marriage have to do

36:36.940 --> 36:37.970
with your ex-girlfriend cheating on you?

36:37.970 --> 36:39.240
In my opinion,

36:39.380 --> 36:41.190
only when we live together

36:41.220 --> 36:42.730
can we know

36:42.790 --> 36:44.870
each other's strengths and weaknesses.

36:44.870 --> 36:46.670
This way, we'll know

36:46.670 --> 36:47.500
if we are

36:47.500 --> 36:49.760
the right person for each other to marry.

36:51.980 --> 36:53.020
To put it plainly,

36:53.160 --> 36:54.890
you want to live with me, right?

36:57.380 --> 36:58.490
That's what I mean.

36:59.100 --> 37:00.780
You don't have anything
to do after dinner, do you?

37:00.780 --> 37:02.710
Why don't you come over to my place?

37:03.040 --> 37:05.530
A lot of people must have
been to your place, right?

37:05.530 --> 37:07.160
No, don't get the wrong idea.

37:07.680 --> 37:09.910
I haven't met the right person.

37:09.940 --> 37:12.070
That's why I kept going on blind dates.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.120
Now that I have you,

37:13.120 --> 37:14.700
I won't go on blind dates anymore.

37:14.700 --> 37:17.700
So, you're bringing me over
just to show me your place?

37:17.830 --> 37:18.540
Qian Fei.

37:19.580 --> 37:21.770
If you truly accept me,

37:21.870 --> 37:24.230
you could stay over tonight.

37:24.260 --> 37:25.790
Even though my place is rented,

37:25.790 --> 37:26.980
my bed is a double one.

37:26.980 --> 37:28.910
There's enough room for both of us.

37:32.500 --> 37:33.750
Wait, where are you going?

37:33.750 --> 37:34.610
I'm going home.

37:34.710 --> 37:36.100
We haven't even eaten yet.

37:36.100 --> 37:37.410
Why don't we sit down and talk?

37:37.410 --> 37:39.870
I don't think we have anything
to talk about.

37:40.060 --> 37:41.220
Are you messing with me?

37:41.220 --> 37:42.160
Why are you grabbing me?

37:42.160 --> 37:43.740
-Let go.
-Was I too polite to you?

37:43.740 --> 37:45.300
Let go first.

38:05.270 --> 38:06.410
Watch your mouth.

38:07.420 --> 38:08.500
Who are you?

38:08.500 --> 38:09.760
None of your business.

38:09.980 --> 38:11.100
If you want to take advantage of a girl,

38:11.100 --> 38:12.870
find a better excuse.

38:12.940 --> 38:14.020
Talking about black holes or something

38:14.020 --> 38:15.270
would make you look somewhat educated.

38:15.270 --> 38:16.460
Psychological disorders?

38:16.460 --> 38:17.100
Let me tell you something.

38:17.100 --> 38:18.630
You are a psychopath.

38:19.150 --> 38:19.790
Well said.

38:20.270 --> 38:22.350
Here is a chance for you to add something.

38:22.350 --> 38:24.100
Forget it. I can't be bothered
to scold him.

38:24.100 --> 38:26.900
What are you afraid of?
Just say whatever you want.

38:28.640 --> 38:30.260
You're a public servant.

38:30.280 --> 38:32.110
Does your leader know you're such a jerk?

38:32.110 --> 38:33.370
What are you thinking?

38:33.500 --> 38:35.630
Do you really think he has a decent job?

38:36.910 --> 38:38.370
So you two know each other.

38:38.500 --> 38:39.670
Qian Fei, you brought a boy toy along

38:39.670 --> 38:40.710
on a blind date with me, huh?

38:40.710 --> 38:42.310
Who are you calling a boy toy?

38:43.940 --> 38:44.800
Say that again.

38:44.820 --> 38:45.300
Come on.

38:45.320 --> 38:46.900
-Wait, Qian Fei.
-Say it again.

38:46.900 --> 38:48.420
Fine, you have guts. Just you wait.

38:48.420 --> 38:50.060
Qian Fei, I'll remember you.

38:50.090 --> 38:51.370
Just you wait.

38:56.630 --> 38:57.950
Are you okay?

38:58.020 --> 39:01.150
I didn't expect you to be
so handsome and quite fierce.

39:01.730 --> 39:02.930
Leave me your number.

39:03.900 --> 39:04.540
I...

39:04.580 --> 39:06.270
If you become my personal trainer,

39:06.270 --> 39:07.330
I will consider it.

39:07.790 --> 39:08.850
Personal trainer?

39:14.100 --> 39:14.670
You.

39:24.100 --> 39:24.900
Li Yifei.

39:26.230 --> 39:28.310
Do you have a violent streak?

39:29.940 --> 39:31.580
What nonsense are you talking about?

39:31.580 --> 39:34.460
Everybody loves me.

39:34.540 --> 39:35.870
They will be enchanted by me.

39:35.870 --> 39:37.200
Beat everyone you meet.

39:37.670 --> 39:39.730
What nonsense are you talking about?

39:41.380 --> 39:43.380
Tell me, as for that guy with glasses

39:43.980 --> 39:45.190
and Wang Ruohai,

39:45.580 --> 39:47.780
did either of them act like a decent man?

39:48.270 --> 39:50.530
I'm just ridding the world of evil, okay?

39:51.380 --> 39:52.010
You...

39:52.060 --> 39:54.530
No, I'm clearly helping you.

39:54.630 --> 39:56.430
Why are you scolding me instead?

39:56.980 --> 39:58.180
I'm just teasing you.

40:00.580 --> 40:02.230
Why do you seem even angrier

40:02.310 --> 40:03.970
than me, the person involved?

40:04.980 --> 40:06.060
Let me tell you,

40:06.100 --> 40:07.830
stop going on blind dates
with these bastards.

40:07.830 --> 40:08.500
Hear me?

40:08.980 --> 40:10.230
You're just so naive.

40:10.260 --> 40:12.460
But you always ask for getting tricked.

40:13.390 --> 40:14.230
Wait.

40:14.980 --> 40:15.500
What?

40:16.750 --> 40:17.500
Well.

40:19.500 --> 40:21.230
Why do you care so much about me?

40:23.150 --> 40:23.870
I...

40:26.510 --> 40:27.580
Because...

40:28.310 --> 40:29.300
I am your Master.

40:30.190 --> 40:32.590
It's natural for a teacher
to care about his mentee,

40:32.590 --> 40:33.270
isn't it?

40:35.750 --> 40:36.540
And you!

40:38.160 --> 40:40.560
Do you really want to get
married that much?

40:40.710 --> 40:42.370
You just broke up not long ago.

40:42.420 --> 40:44.050
Why the rush to go on random blind dates?

40:44.050 --> 40:45.690
I didn't want. I...

40:46.420 --> 40:47.680
Forget it. Never mind.

40:50.060 --> 40:51.390
What's wrong with me?

40:51.580 --> 40:53.630
I haven't even paid off my mortgage yet.

40:53.630 --> 40:54.920
Work is my true love.

40:55.580 --> 40:57.420
Work first, screw love.

41:00.150 --> 41:02.540
Oh no, I shot myself in the foot.

41:02.670 --> 41:03.270
What?

41:04.230 --> 41:04.980
Nothing.

41:05.750 --> 41:07.390
Let's go. Let's go home.

41:10.940 --> 41:11.770
Are you cold?

41:12.540 --> 41:13.150
No.

41:13.870 --> 41:14.350
Really?

41:16.350 --> 41:17.480
It's fine if you are.

41:17.830 --> 41:19.690
Because I have thick skin, right?

41:20.900 --> 41:21.870
Fei.

41:23.460 --> 41:24.100
Jinzi.

41:24.790 --> 41:25.570
Why are you here?

41:25.570 --> 41:27.140
We had a gathering tonight.

41:27.170 --> 41:28.350
But you suddenly said you wouldn't come.

41:28.350 --> 41:30.350
I was worried that you might be sick,

41:30.460 --> 41:31.830
so I asked Zihao.

41:31.830 --> 41:32.970
He said you live here.

41:32.970 --> 41:34.370
Then I came to try my luck.

41:35.600 --> 41:36.430
Well, Jinzi.

41:37.420 --> 41:38.490
Hello, I am Qian Fei.

41:38.490 --> 41:40.220
And I am Li Yifei's colleague.

41:40.880 --> 41:42.210
Can you speak properly?

41:43.940 --> 41:45.270
She's also my landlady.

41:46.020 --> 41:46.750
I saw you

41:46.780 --> 41:48.550
outside the KTV that night.

41:50.310 --> 41:52.310
You guys chat. I'll go inside first.

42:01.150 --> 42:01.830
Fei.

42:02.410 --> 42:04.150
With your family's background,

42:04.150 --> 42:06.210
why do you need to share an apartment?

42:06.450 --> 42:07.850
My family's background?

42:10.750 --> 42:12.010
Zihao told you, right?

42:12.060 --> 42:13.630
Didn't he tell you

42:13.790 --> 42:15.940
that I don't like others
mentioning my family?

42:15.940 --> 42:17.420
And I especially dislike it
when someone shows up

42:17.420 --> 42:18.670
without an appointment.

42:18.670 --> 42:19.750
It's very awkward.

42:20.780 --> 42:22.510
I'm sorry. I was presumptuous.

42:22.820 --> 42:24.420
I was just worried about you.

42:25.800 --> 42:26.550
Also,

42:27.100 --> 42:29.150
am I still just an outsider to you?

42:31.080 --> 42:33.020
Actually, I wanted to ask you.

42:33.150 --> 42:34.580
Why on New Year's Eve

42:34.580 --> 42:36.500
the person you were with
was your landlady?

42:36.500 --> 42:37.630
I knew she drank too much.

42:37.630 --> 42:39.790
Is it necessary for you to take her home?

42:39.790 --> 42:42.370
Didn't you say you hate women drinking,

42:42.460 --> 42:44.060
especially losing control?

42:45.600 --> 42:46.200
Jinzi.

42:47.280 --> 42:49.380
It has nothing to do with you, right?

42:51.980 --> 42:53.660
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.900 --> 42:55.670
What does she like you?

42:55.710 --> 42:56.290
You are just a poor guy

42:56.290 --> 42:57.870
who shares an apartment with me.

42:57.870 --> 42:58.500
Qian Fei,

42:59.020 --> 43:00.020
tell me the truth.

43:00.040 --> 43:01.440
Are you a little jealous?

43:01.970 --> 43:03.120
Fei.

43:05.980 --> 43:06.890
I think

43:07.020 --> 43:08.770
we shouldn't use gossip to distract them,

43:08.770 --> 43:10.880
but let them vent their emotions

43:11.270 --> 43:12.710
and then face their own mistakes.

43:12.710 --> 43:13.710
That makes sense.

43:13.740 --> 43:15.340
As expected of
an investment banking elite,

43:15.340 --> 43:17.360
you hit the nail on the head.

43:17.580 --> 43:20.340
As for the work of
the Shanlifang joint sponsor team,

43:20.340 --> 43:21.640
we won't need you for now.

43:21.640 --> 43:22.440
Why?
